# Native build artifacts (Phase 6)
# third_party/llama.cpp is a vendored upstream tree, cloned at a pinned commit (a868c3e). The
# SOURCE is not committed: it is 213 MB and reproducible from the commit hash. The BUILD OUTPUT
# is not committed either: it is 96 MB of static libraries, regenerated by the documented cmake
# command in DTCA1Worker/app/src/main/cpp/CMakeLists.txt.
third_party/

# Model artifacts
# The GGUF model is ~1.04 GiB and is NOT committed. It is identified by name, size and SHA-256 in
# ModelContract (PixelDesktop/Inference/ModelProvisioning.swift), which is what makes provisioning
# a verified operation rather than a hopeful copy. Reproduce with:
#   curl -L -o models/qwen2.5-1.5b-instruct-q4_k_m.gguf \
#     https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct-GGUF/resolve/main/qwen2.5-1.5b-instruct-q4_k_m.gguf
models/
